    {
        "content": "<p>fitzgen opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14113\">PR #14113</a> from <code>fitzgen:use-clif-trap-inst-in-fused-adapters</code> to <code>bytecodealliance:main</code>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Before, we would emit a call to a host function, passing the trap code as a<br>\nconstant argument. Now we emit a <code>trap &lt;code&gt;</code> instruction directly.</p>\n<p>This is a large improvement for our sync adapter disas tests.</p>\n<p>Depends on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14111\">https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14111</a></p>\n</blockquote>",
        "id": 615711688,
